= Make the signal legible

#quote[An alert is useful only when it points toward the next decision.]

Signal Room groups related events into a timeline, keeps ownership visible, and
shows which evidence changed the current assessment.

== Progressive detail

The default view stays quiet. Operators can expand raw events and diagnostics
without forcing that density on everyone following the incident.

=== Findings from testing

- Keep the current hypothesis beside the timeline.
- Make handoffs explicit and reversible.
